WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:05.839
One must earn everything they acquire in life.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:12.540
Life may be free, but living is not and therefore,
we all must work for it.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:19.750
Working is essential in life, but what’s
important is what kind of work is essential

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.810
to YOU.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:27.929
Working is needed for survival and the acquisition
of personal luxuries, but you must not only

00:00:27.929 --> 00:00:31.800
look at work in terms of what it can give
you.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.730
You must also consider what your work can
give the world.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:41.760
You must consider the world as a massive and
intricate puzzle that you are an individual

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.590
piece of.

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:50.399
Find out what piece you are and where it fits
to help complete the puzzle’s image.

00:00:50.399 --> 00:00:55.649
Look inward and admit to yourself what it
is that you possess.

00:00:55.649 --> 00:01:01.559
What it is that you are good at and enjoy,
and what the world needs from you.

00:01:01.559 --> 00:01:07.340
This is the work that we each must dedicate
ourselves to.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:14.520
In terms of self-purpose in life, it is unlikely
that anyone has a divine destiny, but it IS

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:21.400
likely that life works itself out through
the maze of the world in order to accomplish

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:26.360
the purpose you encode into your subconscious.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:31.510
Work towards developing that purpose and fearlessly
act on its behalf.

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:40.100
The manifestation of your purpose starts with
undivided belief in it and ends with undivided

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.630
attention towards it.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:51.170
To paraphrase American Transcendentalist,
Ralph Waldo Emerson, “if a man has failed,

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:56.100
it is because he has only dreamt and never
worked.”

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:01.460
It is the pairing of dreaming and working
that provides a person with the ability to

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:06.580
pull dreams out of dream world and into the
real world.

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:11.700
Like a newborn baby, dreams cannot initially
walk on their own.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:13.340
You must first carry them.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:17.010
You must be patient and care for them.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:23.810
Soon, they will learn to walk and soon they
will grow strong and powerful.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:30.631
By contributing honestly and whole-heartedly
what it is that you have for the world, you

00:02:30.631 --> 00:02:35.230
transform work into vitality and wonder.

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:42.880
It becomes mutual for you, the individual,
and the world, the collective.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:46.510
Working does not have to be a debilitating
thing.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:51.530
It can be an energizing and satisfying thing.

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:58.900
Look for and uncover what fits your unique
self and follow it to the end of the world.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:02.239
If done properly, you will be compensated.

